        rdfs:comment "Cites Wolfram (1983, 1984, 2002), the 2019 Wolfram Rule 30 Prize, OEIS A051023, Jen (1990), Meinhardt & Klingler (1987), Raup (1966), and both Wikimedia Commons specimen photographs in `datasets/conus/paper_citations.bib`, with SHA-256 locks verified on `conus_textile_reference.json` and both specimen JPEGs. Evidence: datasets/conus/paper_citations.bib L1–L95: Complete BibTeX citations for primary papers, OEIS/Rule 30 Prize, and Commons specimens <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/fb234bc/datasets/conus/paper_citations.bib#L1-L95>; datasets/conus/conus_textile_reference.json L1–L80: SHA-256 pinned specimen metadata, RLE masks, and OEIS A051023 benchmark <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/fb234bc/datasets/conus/conus_textile_reference.json#L1-L80>." ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:evaluatesHypothesis <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/hypothesis/morphoeval-wolfram-conus-textile-rule30-source-traceability> ;
        pk:hasProbability "0.9"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/hypothesis/morphoeval-wolfram-conus-textile-rule30-source-traceability> rdfs:label "Wolfram (1984) Rule 30 & Meinhardt–Klingler (1987) Conus textile Pigmentation (1984-wolfram-conus-textile-rule30.py, docs/media/conus_textile_rule30.gif, docs/media/conus_rule30_kymograph_defect_fronts.png, conus_textile_rule30_metrics.csv, conus_rule30_defect_fronts.csv) satisfies the MorphoEval 0.1.0 criterion 'Source and data traceability' for Conus textile Linnaeus, 1758 (textile cone snail)" ;
